```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant FA as 🎩 Founder-Advisor
    participant PF as 📋 Project File
    participant SA as 🏗️ Solution Architect
    participant PL as 👔 Product Lead
    participant PD as 👨‍💼 Principal Developer
    participant QA as 🧪 QA Engineer
    participant DE as 🚀 DevOps Engineer

    U->>FA: /ts-new-project my-app
    FA->>PF: Create project file & initial state
    FA->>U: Project created, describe your idea

    U->>FA: "Build a blog with posts and comments"
    FA->>PF: Update Meta section with idea
    FA->>SA: Route to Solution Architect

    Note over SA: Architecture Assessment
    SA->>PF: Write technology recommendations
    SA->>SA: Calculate AI success score
    SA->>PF: Update SA Assessment section
    SA->>FA: Return control with recommendations

    FA->>U: Architecture complete, approve?
    U->>FA: /ts-approve architecture-lock
    FA->>PF: Update approval status

    FA->>PL: Route to Product Lead

    Note over PL: MVP Definition
    PL->>PF: Write user stories & MVP scope
    PL->>FA: Return control

    FA->>U: Product definition complete
    U->>FA: /ts-approve green-light
    FA->>PF: Update project status to "IN_DEVELOPMENT"

    FA->>PD: Route to Principal Developer

    Note over PD: Implementation Planning
    PD->>PF: Write implementation plan
    PD->>QA: Coordinate testing strategy
    QA->>PF: Write test plan
    QA->>PD: Return coordination

    PD->>DE: Coordinate deployment needs
    DE->>PF: Write infrastructure requirements
    DE->>PD: Return coordination

    PD->>FA: Development planning complete
    FA->>U: Ready for development execution

    Note over PF: State maintained throughout
    Note over FA: Central routing & coordination
```